          "intro": {
            "zh": "高铁一小时，从上海钻进绍兴的水巷、旧宅与竹林，也走进那些从课本里认识了很多年的名字。",
            "en": "One hour from Shanghai by train, we stepped into Shaoxing's canals, old homes, and bamboo groves — and into names we had known from schoolbooks for years."
