            "zh": "周五夜里，先抵达江南",
            "en": "Friday Night, Arriving in Jiangnan"
          },
          "subtitle": {
            "zh": "上海虹桥 → 绍兴北站 · 云朵酒店",
            "en": "Shanghai Hongqiao → Shaoxing North · Yun Duo Hotel"
          },
          "icon": "🚄"
        },
        {
